# Game Mechanics

## Secret Agent

Public: name, codename, portrait, archetype, publicSummary, level, xp, missionCount, winRate, tokenId, agentId, owner.

Private (encrypted 0G Storage): personality, skills (infiltration, socialEngineering, forgery, surveillance, exfiltration, tech, combatRestraint 0–100), behaviorRules, memoryDigest.

## Mission

`criteriaCommitment = keccak256(abi.encodePacked(hiddenCriteria, salt))` published at creation; criteria revealed after `endsAt`.

Durations: daily | weekly | monthly | demo (5-minute Bureau test window). Status: scheduled | open | evaluating | settled | cancelled.

## MissionPlay

Structured JSON: approach, steps (3–8), risksAccepted, resourcesUsed, contingencies, finalOutcomeClaim, playHash. Sealed until settle.

## Rubric (100 pts)

objectiveFit 30, constraintCompliance 25, tradecraftQuality 25, characterConsistency 20.

## Payouts

Pool = entry fees. Rank by total desc; tie → earlier submit. Top-10: 40/20/12/8/6 + 14% for 6–10. Under 5 entrants: 50/30/20.

## Evaluation fairness

Same model + promptVersion, temperature 0, seed = keccak256(missionId, agentTokenId, playHash). No agent↔evaluator chat.
